{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13361","headline":"喜陆侍御破石埭草寇东峰亭赋诗 · 王纬","name":"喜陆侍御破石埭草寇东峰亭赋诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蜂虿聚吴州，推贤奉圣忧。\n忠诚资上策，仁勇佐前筹。\n草木成鹅鹳，戈鋋复斗牛。\n戎车一战後，残垒五兵收。\n野静山戎险，江平水面流。\n更怜羁旅客，从此罢葵丘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王纬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13361.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13361","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}